 will be issued this afternoon at 400 PM CDT.","response":"Avoid","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["FLSILX"],"WMOidentifier":["WGUS83 KILX 291541"],"NWSheadline":["FLOOD WARNING NOW IN EFFECT UNTIL THIS AFTERNOON"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.EXT.KILX.FL.W.0038.000000T0000Z-260829T2100Z/"],"eventEndingTime":["2026-08-29T16:00:00-05:00"],"expiredReferences":["w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.e9ba0ec6ecbecaa3845f0aa14c666df5cd00b58b.001.1,2026-08-28T20:55:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.cf144b3fbb1c00e70d11145cd0b83e2f4df23a65.001.1,2026-08-28T09:13:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.668e1ae69338a74e54485f42c8b6cbf9659a53ab.001.1,2026-08-27T20:39:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.a53269587bc5b5a7c2a8f154c30a5de1b5bf705b.001.1,2026-08-27T09:48:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.e58e572d30a7f9919450eb1ec53c819e613e0e40.001.1,2026-08-26T20:32:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.a5ba3eea957db4323b04c5a07c886510d06a1d84.002.1,2026-08-26T09:08:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.2ab065555cfd7495a4250782763d80d6b4cd55f3.001.1,2026-08-25T21:42:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d5b0ee461c0617218c6f8ede27b3ea0a66a50e55.001.1,2026-08-25T08:53:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.c14f38cf836978ebe82026fa568defb4d55265c9.001.1,2026-08-24T21:28:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.c5fe13892ca9f7245240b932d9f9c6a91335fb7b.001.1,2026-08-24T09:46:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.72a20f7d358ad85df5343815c70f2ed5762a4f5f.001.1,2026-08-23T20:25:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.1e0c2b67d94646fcc2a9cb83f75eae7ddc77622f.001.1,2026-08-23T10:41:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov,urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.40c7e0f6f40a4e852c59087376da5b71ebdaebf6.002.1,2026-08-22T20:49:00-05:00 w-nws.webmaster